{"id":"657939","name":"蒜蓉蒸虾","author":"悦来粤菜","authorId":"12208994","desc":"","cover":"images/657939/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"虾","amount":"10条（天然虾最好）"}],"sub":[{"name":"粉丝","amount":"1捆"},{"name":"蒜蓉","amount":"1个"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"生抽，蚝油，糖，鸡精，油，盐。","img":"images/657939/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"虾：虾开两边（尾部保留）去除虾脑和虾线。","img":"images/657939/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"粉丝浸泡好后垫底。","img":"images/657939/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"将虾均匀摆于盘中。","img":"images/657939/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"水开，上锅蒸1分钟后接下一步。","img":"images/657939/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"将调好的蒜蓉酱涂抹均匀。","img":"images/657939/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"再继续蒸5分钟，即可。","img":"images/657939/step_7.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：蒸锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}